nfiguration and platform, even cross-compiling, saving lots of time in development and continuous integration. The binary compatibility can be configured and customized. Manage all your artifacts in the same way on all platforms.\n- Integrates with any build system, including any proprietary and custom one. Provides tested support for major build systems (CMake, MSBuild, Makefiles, Meson, etc).\n- Extensible: Its Python-based recipes, together with extension points allow for great power and flexibility.\n- Large and active community, especially in GitHub (https://github.com/conan-io/conan) and Slack (https://cppalliance.org/slack/ #conan channel). This community also creates and maintains packages in ConanCenter and Bincrafters repositories in Bintray.\n- Stable. Used in production by many companies, since 1.0 there is a commitment not to break package recipes and documented behavior.","name":"Conan Package Manager","packageUrl":"https://conan.io/","publisher":"JFrog","publisherUrl":"https://conan.io/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/conan-io/conan/releases/tag/2.16.1","tags":["c","c++","cmake","conancenter","multi-platform","open-source","package-manager","packagemanager","python","software-repository","softwarerepository"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://conan.io/","releaseDate":"2025-04-29","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/conan-io/conan/releases/tag/2.16.1","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/j/JFrog/Conan/2.16.1/JFrog.Conan.yaml","sha256":"68ba5c229d125afa08c8dd4c1af4203f67edaa3f4d4612b78702d496b75815e3"},{"path":"manifests/j/JFrog/Conan/2.16.1/JFrog.Conan.installer.yaml","sha256":"720bd4af464d728a7ebb889f0fe99c308df1d9c9dc0ad9173c7645933d9ee4f0"},{"path":"manifests/j/JFrog/Conan/2.16.1/JFrog.Conan.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"1a4842eadb589a0280d9c794123b1efaae405078046c65dd67fdc798d9943b59"}],"repository